{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Tech Challenge 4 — AWS dev",
    "description": "Requisições do ambiente dev em Ohio. Atualize as variáveis com as saídas da stack fiap-tc4-dev caso os endpoints mudem. O cadastro grava uma avaliação na Neon. A invocação do relatório pode enviar e-mail real pelo SES.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "feedbackEndpoint",
      "value": "https://alj5wpz2o0.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/avaliacao"
    },
    {
      "key": "notificationsApiUrl",
      "value": "https://uhaihmruhj.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "awsRegion",
      "value": "us-east-2"
    },
    {
      "key": "weeklyReportFunctionName",
      "value": "dev-weekly-report"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Feedback service — Cadastrar avaliação crítica",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.test('Avaliação classificada como CRITICAL', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().urgencia).to.eql('CRITICAL');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"descricao\": \"Teste de avaliação na AWS\",\n  \"nota\": 2\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{feedbackEndpoint}}",
          "host": [
            "{{feedbackEndpoint}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Grava uma avaliação na Neon. Confira o encaminhamento no grupo /aws/lambda/dev-critical-notifications do CloudWatch."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Critical notifications — Enviar aviso direto",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Aviso processado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().processed).to.eql(true));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "awsv4",
          "awsv4": [
            {
              "key": "accessKey",
              "value": "{{AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "secretKey",
              "value": "{{AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "region",
              "value": "{{awsRegion}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "service",
              "value": "execute-api",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"Teste direto de notificação na AWS\",\n  \"rating\": 2,\n  \"urgency\": \"CRITICAL\",\n  \"submittedAt\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{notificationsApiUrl}}/notifications",
          "host": [
            "{{notificationsApiUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "notifications"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Requer assinatura AWS e execute-api:Invoke na rota POST /notifications. Envia um e-mail real de teste pelo SES aos administradores."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Weekly report — Enviar relatório semanal",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Lambda concluiu sem erro', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has('X-Amz-Function-Error')).to.eql(false));",
              "pm.test('Relatório enviado', () => {",
              "    const result = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(result.periodStart).to.match(/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/);",
              "    pm.expect(result.periodEnd).to.match(/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/);",
              "    pm.expect(result.feedbackCount).to.be.a('number');",
              "    pm.expect(result.averageRating).to.be.a('number');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "awsv4",
          "awsv4": [
            {
              "key": "accessKey",
              "value": "{{AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "secretKey",
              "value": "{{AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "region",
              "value": "{{awsRegion}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "key": "service",
              "value": "lambda",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Amz-Invocation-Type",
            "value": "RequestResponse"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"responseFormat\": \"json\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://lambda.{{awsRegion}}.amazonaws.com/2015-03-31/functions/{{weeklyReportFunctionName}}/invocations",
          "host": [
            "lambda",
            "{{awsRegion}}",
            "amazonaws",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "2015-03-31",
            "functions",
            "{{weeklyReportFunctionName}}",
            "invocations"
          ],
          "protocol": "https"
        },
        "description": "Invocação síncrona com AWS Signature. Preencha AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID e AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY como valores locais no ambiente ativo do Postman. Para credenciais temporárias, configure também o campo Session Token. Esta chamada envia um e-mail real aos destinatários configurados."
      }
    }
  ]
}
